  "prefLabel": "He-P 4062.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4062.02 Scope. This rule shall apply to any person involved in the transfer for disposal and disposal of waste, including the waste generator, waste collector, waste processor, and disposal facility operator.",
